# Raw downloads: re-download with the module scripts. Keep provenance notes and small hand-made tables.
mh370-open/data/raw/**
!mh370-open/data/raw/**/
!mh370-open/data/raw/**/SOURCE.md
!mh370-open/data/raw/**/*.csv
!mh370-open/data/raw/**/*.json

